Package: precisionSim
Type: Package
Title: Estimate Sample Size For Linear Mixed Models Based On Precision
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Nirav", "Maniar",
      email = "Nirav.Maniar@acu.edu.au",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Estimates the probability the user-defined estimands achieve pre-specified confidence interval widths from linear mixed models. Methods are provided for single samples or for multiple candidate sample sizes.
